<p>Haaye Hussain, Haaye Hussain</p>

<p>Shimr Ne Gardan E Mazloom Pe Khanjar Jo Rakha<br>
Kuchh Qadam Door Se Deti Rahi Zainab Ye Sada<br>
Aakhri Baar Bahen Choom Le Bhai Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

<p>Teer Jee Bhar Ke Ise Maar Chuka Hai Lashkar<br>
Barchhiyan Pahlu Me Tooti Hain Sitam Aur Na Kar<br>
Khud Hi Aa Jayegi Kuchh Der Mein Bhai Ko Qaza<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala<br>
Aakhri Baar Bahen Choom Le Bhai Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

<p>Minnaten Karti Hoon Zalim Teri Aisa Tu Na Kar<br>
