Shaam Se Pehle Bujhaata Hai Charagh E Zahra<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala<br>
Aakhri Baar Bahen Choom Le Bhai Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

<p>Sun Ke Halmin Ki Sada Aayi Hai Rann Me Bachchi<br>
Chal Na Jaaye Kahin Donon Pe Layeen Teri Chhuri<br>
Dekh Bhai Ke Gale Par Hai Sakina Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala<br>
Aakhri Baar Bahen Choom Le Bhai Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

<p>Dekh Sakta Nahi Tu Jo Nazar Aata Hai Mujhe<br>
Wasta Deti Hoon Tatheer Ki Aayat Ka Tujhe<br>
Haath Amma Ne Hai Shabbir Ki Gardan Pe Rakha<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala<br>
Aakhri Baar Bahen Choom Le Bhai Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

<p>Kaat Kar Sajde Mein Akbar Shahe Wala Ka Gala<br>
Shimr Hansta Hua Shabbir Ke Seene Se Utha<br>
Goonjti Rah Gayi Maqtal Mein Ye Zainab Ki Sada<br>
Shimr Khanjar Na Chala</p>

